        "title": "Apple Maps is launching ads on iPhone soon, here’s what to expect",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/13/apple-maps-is-launching-ads-on-iphone-soon-heres-what-to-expect/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/03/maps.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>iOS 26.5 arrived this week and brought an <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/ios-26-5s-apple-maps-app-has-two-notable-changes-heres-whats-new/\">Apple Maps popup</a> notifying users that ads are coming soon. Here’s what to expect when they formally launch this summer.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-maps\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052023\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/13/apple-maps-is-launching-ads-on-iphone-soon-heres-what-to-expect/#more-1052023\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
