        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/apple-work-podcast-the-2026-trends-around-apple-device-management/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/08/Apple-at-Work-Liquid-Glass-light.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p><em><a href=\"https://mosyle.net/3RDn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Apple @ Work is exclusively brought to you by Mosyle</a>, the only Apple Unified Platform. Mosyle is the only solution that integrates in a single professional-grade platform all the solutions necessary to seamlessly and automatically deploy, manage &amp; protect Apple devices at work. Over 45,000 organizations trust Mosyle to make millions of Apple devices work-ready with no effort and at an affordable cost. </em><a href=\"https://mosyle.net/3RDn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Request your EXTENDED TRIAL</em></a><em> today and understand why Mosyle is everything you need to work with Apple</em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In this episode of Apple @ Work, </span>Jaron Bradley and Michael Covington from Jamf join the show to talk about the latest trends around macOS system management.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/Jamf-Report.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-work-podcast\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1050126\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/apple-work-podcast-the-2026-trends-around-apple-device-management/#more-1050126\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
