        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/court-grants-apples-request-to-seek-samsung-documents-in-doj-antitrust-case/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/12/Apple-Park.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>The U.S. District Court for the District of New Jersey has approved Apple’s request to seek documents from Samsung in South Korea in its ongoing antitrust case against the Department of Justice. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051758\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/court-grants-apples-request-to-seek-samsung-documents-in-doj-antitrust-case/#more-1051758\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
