        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/apple-updates-app-store-rules-for-betting-apps-in-brazil/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/app-store-connect-ios.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Following changes to Brazil’s betting regulation, Apple now requires a Brazilian betting license for fixed-odds betting apps on the App Store. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"app-store,apple-developer\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051755\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/apple-updates-app-store-rules-for-betting-apps-in-brazil/#more-1051755\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
