        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/ios-27-adding-new-way-to-manage-your-safari-tabs-per-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/11/ios-27-concept-05.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>We’re less than a month away from Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/03/23/apple-announces-wwdc-2026-for-june-8-ios-27-set-to-be-revealed/\">announcing</a> iOS 27 at WWDC. A new report today corroborates that Apple is adding a new feature to Safari to help you manage your tabs and stay organized …</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051621\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/ios-27-adding-new-way-to-manage-your-safari-tabs-per-report/#more-1051621\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
