        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://plugsocketmuseum.nl/index.html\">The Digital Museum of Plugs and Sockets</a> is exactly what it says on the tin. Information and photos about electrical connector standards around the world. A classic Web 1.0 site that's clearly a labor of love and asks nothing of the visitor, which is like a glass of cold water in whatever the Internet has turned into today.<br/><br/>It sounds like the owner no longer has the ability to maintain the site, and its future is in question.",
