        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?fit=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"illustration of two men with hats, one holding a rifle\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?w=2000&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=1200%2C800&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=780%2C520&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=400%2C267&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?resize=706%2C471&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/big-game-atavist.jpg?fit=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>\"Colorado’s San Luis Valley was a wildlife poacher’s paradise.\nThen an undercover federal agent arrived.\"",
