        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/13/meta-launches-instants-a-new-iphone-app-and-instagram-feature-for-ephemeral-sharing/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/instagram-instants-app.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Meta just launched a brand new iPhone app called Instants. Built around ephemeral photo sharing, the new social media app is also the latest Instagram feature. Here’s what it does.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,instagram,iphone,meta\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052046\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/13/meta-launches-instants-a-new-iphone-app-and-instagram-feature-for-ephemeral-sharing/#more-1052046\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
