        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/bartender-pro-makes-the-macbook-notch-more-useful-with-widgets-files-clipboard-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/bartender-pro.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Bartender got even more useful today with the release of Bartender Pro and a new feature called Top Shelf, which turns the Mac’s notch into a space for widgets, file storage, clipboard management, Live Activities, and more. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"bartender,mac,macos\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051812\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/bartender-pro-makes-the-macbook-notch-more-useful-with-widgets-files-clipboard-more/#more-1051812\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
