        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-developer-11.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>There’s a new version of the multi-platform Apple Developer app out today ahead of WWDC 2026. Apple Developer version 11.0 introduces a Liquid Glass design ahead of iOS 27.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,wwdc,wwdc-2026\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051702\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/apple-developer-app-gains-liquid-glass-design-and-new-imessage-stickers-for-wwdc/#more-1051702\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
