        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/apple-debuts-new-mac-video-that-says-great-ideas-start-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/mac-students-video-macbook.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple has debuted a new video today to promote the Mac, with students the prime target. It has the tagline ‘Great ideas start here.’</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"mac\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051651\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/11/apple-debuts-new-mac-video-that-says-great-ideas-start-here/#more-1051651\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
